ion":"Provides an APIs for new UI elements and tools","version":"1.0.1","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack/versions/1.0.1/download","hash":"09159f23ba30efce3b3f9ebaac22308aec248fd38932e0a6798f61fa68df319b","geode":"5.0.0-beta.1","download_count":9570,"early_load":true,"requires_patching":false,"api":true,"mod_id":"alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-02-15T01:06:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T01:06:03Z"},{"name":"Alpha's UI Pack","description":"Provides an APIs for new UI elements and tools","version":"1.0.1-beta.2","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack/versions/1.0.1-beta.2/download","hash":"5afe3d60a6c416d1af398d5d8491daedeb5b92e5ad2130c628cf5622439c8af1","geode":"5.0.0-alpha.2","download_count":2289,"early_load":true,"requires_patching":false,"api":true,"mod_id":"alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-02-11T21:19:31Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T21:19:31Z"},{"name":"Alpha's UI Pack","description":"Provides an APIs for new UI elements and tools","version":"1.0.1-beta.1","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack/versions/1.0.1-beta.1/download","hash":"75ad94a5f8e5d7764503a29cad99a83091403b84a45e93bc163569f41d30719f","geode":"5.0.0-alpha.1","download_count":2270,"early_load":true,"requires_patching":false,"api":true,"mod_id":"alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-02-03T23:04:07Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T23:04:07Z"},{"name":"Alpha's UI Pack","description":"Provides an APIs for new UI elements and tools","version":"1.0.0","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack/versions/1.0.0/download","hash":"f76a00fe27407ca689beee811e44f739b059a435d9abff64844af225c0a5bca9","geode":"4.10.0","download_count":29445,"early_load":true,"requires_patching":false,"api":true,"mod_id":"alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack","gd":{"win":"2.2074","android32":"2.2074","android64":"2.2074","mac-intel":"2.2074","mac-arm":"2.2074","ios":"2.2074"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2025-12-27T05:57:01Z","updated_at":"2025-12-27T05:57:01Z"}],"tags":["enhancement","interface","developer","api"],"about":"# Alpha's UI Pack\r\n\r\nProvides a bunch of extra nodes and tools:\r\n\r\n## AdvancedScrollLayer\r\n  - Improved Scroll Layer compared to Cocos, Geode, and Geometry Dash's implementation.\r\n  - Inertia scroll\r\n  - Proper horizontal scroll\r\n  - Keyboard scrolling\r\n  - Top Left origin based\r\n  - Scroll Units instead of manual content positioning\r\n  - Easy to use\r\n## AdvancedScrollBar\r\n  - Scrolls the AdvancedScrollLayer\r\n## RenderNode\r\n  - Wraps a node and renders it to this as a sprite.\r\n## TouchBlocker\r\n  - Easily block touch based on another node's bounds.\r\n## TouchDispatcher \r\n  - Brings proper hover controls as well as Right, Middle, Button 3, and Button 4 click support.\r\n  - Supports normal touch prio, staying consistent with Geometry Dash.\r\n\r\nYou can include everything with:\r\n```cpp\r\n#include <alphalaneous.alphas-ui-pack/include/API.hpp>\r\n```\r\nor add each header as needed. \r\n\r\nSimilarly, you can bring every namespace to the scope with\r\n```cpp\r\nusing namespace alpha::prelude;\r\n```\r\nor use each namespace as needed.\r\n\r\n**View the headers for proper documentation.**\r\n\r\nYou can view the examples folder for some example code on how to use the provided classes.","changelog":"# 1.4.6\r\n- Add AdvancedScrollLayer::ScrollEvent to listen for when a scroll happens\r\n\r\n# 1.4.5\r\n- Fix a rare crash\r\n\r\n# 1.4.4\r\n- Fix another crash with AdvancedScrollLayer\r\n\r\n# 1.4.3\r\n- Fix a crash\r\n- Fix a bug where scroll layer touch would also happen behind it and that would never get ended/cancelled\r\n- Code cleanup\r\n\r\n# 1.4.2\r\n- Fix some touch issues\r\n\r\n# 1.4.1\r\n- Fix includes\r\n\r\n# 1.4.0\r\n- Add MirrorNode, a cleaner alternative to RenderNode\r\n- Fix clicking on scrollbar track with content smaller than the height of the scroll layer causing the scroll content to become invisible\r\n- Improve AdvancedScrollLayer touch logic, no longer relying on hacky touch prio stuff\r\n- Make TouchDispatcher safer\r\n- Add node IDs\r\n- Add the ability to disable keyboard scroll on AdvancedScrollLayer\r\n\r\n# 1.3.4\r\n- Remove fix for iOS only for now\r\n\r\n# 1.3.3\r\n- Clipping Node fix (Thanks Undefined)\r\n\r\n# 1.3.2\r\n- Move render out of visit\r\n\r\n# 1.3.1\r\n- Fix ABI\r\n\r\n# 1.3.0\r\n- Add resetFBO method to RenderNode\r\n- Fix some RenderNode bugs\r\n- Fix culling being late by a frame when dragging\r\n- Fix crashes with QOLMod when scrolling and a RenderNode is on screen\r\n\r\n# 1.2.2\r\n- Fix Premultiplied Alpha being false and causing dark edges on rendered nodes\r\n\r\n# 1.2.1\r\n- Whoops, broke inertia, now I fixed it!\r\n\r\n# 1.2.0\r\n- Add force cull method\r\n- Add offsetScroll methods\r\n\r\n# 1.1.2\r\n- Revert scroll changes\r\n\r\n# 1.1.1\r\n- Switch to events for mouse buttons and scroll\r\n\r\n# 1.1.0\r\n- Add missing Scroll Delta getter and Setter\r\n\r\n# 1.0.8\r\n- RenderNode fixes\r\n\r\n# 1.0.7\r\n- Fix potential leak on orphaned RenderNodes\r\n\r\n# 1.0.6\r\n- Fixes for Better Touch Prio mod\r\n\r\n# 1.0.5\r\n- Fix a potential memory leak\r\n\r\n# 1.0.4\r\n- Remove cursor support for all platforms. Too annoying to deal with.\r\n\r\n# 1.0.3\r\n- Removing cursor support on MacOS for now. Restoring state is impossible currently.\r\n- Fix some ScrollLayer bugs\r\n\r\n# 1.0.2\r\n- Reset cursor on close\r\n\r\n# 1.0.1\r\n- Fix blending bleeding into RoundedScrollHandle and RoundedScrollTrack\r\n- Fix typo: `AdvancedScrollLayer::setVeritcalScroll` is now `AdvancedScrollLayer::setVerticalScroll`\r\n\r\n# 1.0.1-beta.2\r\n- Geode Alpha 2 support\r\n- Switch to geode::NineSlice\r\n- Disable touch blocker by default (touch prio is funky), it is easier to handle that on your own as a dev\r\n- Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n# 1.0.1-beta.1\r\n- 2.2081 Support\r\n- Fix minor bug when dragging with anything other than left click\r\n- Temporarily disable DevTools support\r\n\r\n# 1.0.0\r\n- Initial Release\r\n","created_at":"2025-12-27T05:59:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:17:21Z","links":{"community":"https://discord.gg/Txn2CA5dHF","homepage":"https://linktr.ee/Alphalaneous","source":"https://github.com/Alphalaneous/Alphas-UI-Pack"}}